; Example only. Adapt paths/context names to the live SeasonalPBX dialplan.
;
; The default CLI stdout is digit-only, which is the safest Asterisk contract.
; stderr contains diagnostics and is captured by normal process/service logging.
;
; Example SHELL usage:
; same => n,Set(CAPTCHA_RESULT=${SHELL(/opt/seasonal-vcaptcha/venv/bin/seasonal-vcaptcha-digits /var/spool/asterisk/tmp/captcha.wav)})
; same => n,NoOp(VCaptcha result: ${CAPTCHA_RESULT})
